<SCENARIO VER="105">
{PLAYSND "環境音\公園野次馬.ogg" "SE" "REPEAT" "0" "0"}
{CHGVOL "SE" "900" "2000" "WAIT"}
{WAIT "3000" "CLICK" "SKIP"}
{CREATECG "000" "グラフィック\シナリオ\公園.gal" "NORMAL" "#1" "C" "B" "0" "1" "3000" "0" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "255" ""}
{WAIT "1000" "CLICK" "SKIP"}
{CHGVOL "SE" "700" "1000" "PASS"}
{CREATECG "人物1" "グラフィック\立ち絵\人物\春花バストアップ.gal" "NORMAL" "#1" "R" "B" "0" "1" "500" "0" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "255" ""}
{MESON "500"}
{CREATECG "文字カウント画像" "グラフィック\システム\文字カウント画像.gal" "NORMAL" "#1" "C" "B" "0" "1" "0" "0" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "255" ""}
<TXSPN>"What a crowd..."
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="1">For a park it was nothing as grand as the ones in the city, just a children's park about 100m on a side.</STYLE><PG>
{MESOFF "500"}
{CREATECG "111" "グラフィック\背景\フェンス.gal" "NORMAL" "#1" "C" "B" "100" "1" "1000" "0" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "255" ""}
{MESON "500"}
<STYLE ID="1">The play equipment was gathered together in the middle, and cherry trees stood in a ring around it.</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="1">The outside was closed in by a fence about 1m20cm high, so the inside of the park could be seen from anywhere.</STYLE><PG>
<STYLE ID="1">Naturally the park was off-limits.</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="1">Several police officers were still at work.</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="1">The blue sheet I had seen in the photo online had been taken away.</STYLE><PG>
<STYLE ID="1">Around it stood a group that had to be the press, and outside them dozens of rubberneckers had gathered.</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="1">No doubt the residents of that bulletin board were mixed in among them.</STYLE><PG>
{MESOFF "500"}
{CHANGECG "人物1" "グラフィック\立ち絵\人物\春花腕組み.gal" "NORMAL" "1" "0" "0" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "255" ""}
{DELETECG "111" "1" "1000" "0" "0" "" "0"}
{MESON "500"}
"Honestly, every last one of them... Don't these guys have anything else to do...?"
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="1">Though that was hardly something </STYLE>Haruka<STYLE ID="1"> could say.</STYLE><PG>
"At this rate the food stalls are probably closed for a while too. Good thing we went yesterday..."<PG>
{MESOFF "500"}
{STOPSND "SE" "1000" "PASS"}
{DELETECG "000,人物1" "1" "500" "0" "0" "" "0"}
{WAIT "500" "CLICK" "SKIP"}
{PLAYSND "SE\軽くぶつかる.ogg" "VOICE" "NORMAL" "1000" "0"}
{MESON "500"}
<STYLE ID="2">"</STYLE><STYLE ID="3" RUBY="こごおり">Kogori</STYLE><STYLE ID="4">-senpaaai</STYLE><STYLE ID="2">! </STYLE><STYLE ID="5" RUBY="にいむら">Niimura</STYLE>-senpaaai<STYLE ID="2">!"</STYLE> [TN: senpai = an older schoolmate]<PG>
{MESOFF "0"}
{CREATECG "000" "グラフィック\シナリオ\公園.gal" "NORMAL" "#1" "C" "B" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "255" ""}
{CREATECG "人物2" "グラフィック\立ち絵\人物\春花腕組み全身.gal" "NORMAL" "#1" "300" "B" "0" "1" "3000" "0" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "255" ""}
{WAIT "1000" "CLICK" "SKIP"}
{MESON "500"}
<STYLE ID="1">No sooner had a girl's shout gone up than somebody slammed into us from behind.</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="1">There is only one girl who calls us senpai and greets us like this.</STYLE><PG>
{MESOFF "500"}
{CREATECG "人物1" "グラフィック\立ち絵\人物\五島.gal" "NORMAL" "#1" "R" "B" "0" "1" "500" "0" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "255" ""}
{MESON "500"}
<STYLE ID="2">"So you were both here!"</STYLE>
{PLAYSND "五島.ogg" "BGM" "REPEAT" "1000" "0"}
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
"Huh? <STYLE ID="6" RUBY="ごとう">Goto</STYLE>, is it. So <STYLE ID="2">you</STYLE> came here too."
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="2">"Yes! Did you two just get here, Senpai?"</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="6" RUBY="ごとう">Goto</STYLE><STYLE ID="1"> grinned from ear to ear.</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
{MESOFF "500"}
{CHANGECG "人物2" "グラフィック\立ち絵\人物\春花腰に手1.gal" "NORMAL" "1" "500" "0" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "255" ""}
{MESON "500"}
"I was so bored I dragged <STYLE ID="4">Natsumi</STYLE> out here by force."<PG>
<STYLE ID="1">Incidentally, </STYLE><STYLE ID="3" RUBY="こごおり">Kogori</STYLE><STYLE ID="1"> is my family name, and </STYLE><STYLE ID="5" RUBY="にいむら">Niimura</STYLE><STYLE ID="1"> is </STYLE>Haruka<STYLE ID="1">'s.</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="1">And this noisy little thing is </STYLE><STYLE ID="2">Goto</STYLE><STYLE ID="1">, my junior, a year below me.</STYLE><PG>
<STYLE ID="1">She is the very one </STYLE>Haruka<STYLE ID="1"> mentioned in passing yesterday, who ate her way through the food stalls in the park.</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="1">For all that she is as small as a child, she has a bottomless stomach.</STYLE><PG>
{MESOFF "500"}
{CHANGECG "人物2" "グラフィック\立ち絵\人物\春花.gal" "NORMAL" "" "0" "0" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "255" ""}
{CHANGECG "人物1" "グラフィック\立ち絵\人物\五島考える.gal" "NORMAL" "1" "500" "0" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "255" ""}
{MESON "500"}
<STYLE ID="2">"Hm, but are you all right, </STYLE><STYLE ID="4">Kogori-senpai</STYLE><STYLE ID="2">? The cherries don't bother you?"</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="4">"Yeah, I'm feeling strangely good today."</STYLE><PG>
{MESOFF "500"}
{CHANGECG "人物1" "グラフィック\立ち絵\人物\五島.gal" "NORMAL" "1" "500" "0" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "255" ""}
{MESON "500"}
<STYLE ID="2">"Is that so! Then nothing could be finer!</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<STYLE ID="2">　Hey, hey, Senpai, do you two have a little time? Actually, you do, don't you? You came here because you were bored, after all."</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="2">Goto</STYLE><STYLE ID="1">'s one remark made </STYLE>Haruka<STYLE ID="1">'s eyes gleam.</STYLE><PG>
{MESOFF "500"}
{CHANGECG "人物2" "グラフィック\立ち絵\人物\春花腰に手1.gal" "NORMAL" "1" "500" "0" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "255" ""}
{MESON "500"}
"Oh! Have you got some good information or something?"
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="2">"Just what I would expect of </STYLE>Niimura-senpai<STYLE ID="2">! Your nose for this sort of thing is fearsome! In truth, </STYLE>Boss<STYLE ID="2">, it is exactly as you say."</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="6" RUBY="ごとう">Goto</STYLE><STYLE ID="1"> rubbed her hands together and sidled up to </STYLE>Haruka<STYLE ID="1">.</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
{MESOFF "500"}
{CHANGECG "人物2" "グラフィック\立ち絵\人物\春花.gal" "NORMAL" "1" "500" "0" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "255" ""}
{MESON "500"}
"Who are you imitating...?"<PG>
{MESOFF "500"}
{CHANGECG "人物1" "グラフィック\立ち絵\人物\五島挨拶.gal" "NORMAL" "1" "500" "0" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "255" ""}
{MESON "500"}
<STYLE ID="2">"I have been here since morning gathering information of every kind. I am surely the ordinary citizen who knows this incident best!"</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
{MESOFF "500"}
{CHANGECG "人物2" "グラフィック\立ち絵\人物\春花腕組み全身.gal" "NORMAL" "1" "500" "0" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "255" ""}
{MESON "500"}
"<STYLE ID="6" RUBY="ごとう">Goto</STYLE>! Have you had lunch!? This <STYLE ID="5" RUBY="にいむら">Niimura</STYLE>-senpai is treating you!"
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="2">"Oooh! Just what I would expect of the </STYLE>Boss<STYLE ID="2">!</STYLE><STYLE ID="1"> </STYLE><STYLE ID="2">Operation successful!"</STYLE><PG>
"Hah! So you were after lunch all along. Well, I've got the funds today."
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
Haruka<STYLE ID="1"> and </STYLE><STYLE ID="6" RUBY="ごとう">Goto</STYLE><STYLE ID="1"> see eye to eye on this sort of thing.</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="6" RUBY="ごとう">Goto</STYLE><STYLE ID="1"> was the one I met first, but after I brought her together with </STYLE>Haruka<STYLE ID="1"> later on, it has been like this every time.</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="1">Their getting along is a fine thing, but being dragged around by it is very hard work.</STYLE><PG>
{MESOFF "500"}
{DELETECG "人物1,人物2" "1" "500" "0" "0" "" "0"}
{MESON "500"}
"Come on, <STYLE ID="4">Natsumi</STYLE>! Let's go! We're moving to Zahha!"
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="4">"Ah, wait for me!"</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="1">By the time I noticed, the two of them were already astride their bicycles.</STYLE><PG>
{MESOFF "500"}
{DELETECG "000" "1" "500" "0" "0" "" "0"}
{PLAYSND "SE\自転車開始.ogg" "VOICE" "NORMAL" "1000" "0"}
{WAITPLAY "VOICE" "CLICK"}
{PLAYSND "SE\自転車こぐ.ogg" "VOICE" "REPEAT" "1000" "0"}
{WAIT "1000" "CLICK" "SKIP"}
{MESON "500"}
<STYLE ID="1">In the end we were at the park for only 2 or 3 minutes.</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="1">But having run into </STYLE><STYLE ID="2">Goto</STYLE><STYLE ID="1">, it looked as though we would learn all sorts of things.</STYLE><PG>
{MESOFF "500"}
{STOPSND "BGM" "3000" "PASS"}
{STOPSND "VOICE" "3000" "PASS"}
{WAITPLAY "VOICE" "CLICK"}
{CREATECG "000" "グラフィック\背景\ファミレス.gal" "NORMAL" "#1" "C" "B" "0" "1" "3000" "0" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "255" ""}
{PLAYSND "SE\自転車こぐ.ogg" "VOICE" "REPEAT" "0" "0"}
{CHGVOL "VOICE" "1000" "5000" "PASS"}
{WAIT "5000" "CLICK" "SKIP"}
{PLAYSND "SE\自転車ブレーキ.ogg" "VOICE" "NORMAL" "1000" "0"}
{WAITPLAY "VOICE" "CLICK"}
{WAIT "1000" "CLICK" "SKIP"}
{DELETECG "000" "1" "3000" "0" "0" "" "0"}
{WAIT "1000" "CLICK" "SKIP"}
{PLAYSND "環境音\ファミレス.ogg" "SE" "REPEAT" "0" "0"}
{CHGVOL "SE" "800" "3000" "PASS"}
{PLAYSND "SE\店出入り.ogg" "VOICE" "NORMAL" "1000" "0"}
{WAITPLAY "VOICE" "CLICK"}
{CREATECG "000" "グラフィック\背景\ザッハ中.gal" "NORMAL" "#1" "C" "B" "0" "1" "3000" "0" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "255" ""}
{WAIT "1000" "CLICK" "SKIP"}
{MESON "500"}
<STYLE ID="1">We arrived at Zahha.</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="1">We used this family restaurant fairly often.</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="1">Plenty of bicycles that looked like school bikes were parked outside.</STYLE><PG>
<STYLE ID="1">"Welcome. Is it three of you?"</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="1">Zahha was very crowded today.</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="1">From the look of it, it was all groups of high school students.</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="1">High school students overflowing the park and the family restaurant alike. So much for the stay-at-home order.</STYLE><PG>
{MESOFF "500"}
{STOPSND "SE" "5000" "PASS"}
{PLAYSND "日常.ogg" "BGM" "REPEAT" "1000" "0"}
{CREATECG "人物1" "グラフィック\立ち絵\人物\春花バストアップ.gal" "NORMAL" "#1" "R" "B" "0" "1" "500" "0" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "255" ""}
{MESON "500"}
"Right then, <STYLE ID="2">Goto</STYLE>, no holding back! Eat whatever you like!"
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
{MESOFF "500"}
{CREATECG "人物2" "グラフィック\立ち絵\人物\五島挨拶バストアップ.gal" "NORMAL" "#1" "L" "B" "0" "1" "500" "0" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "255" ""}
{MESON "500"}
<STYLE ID="2">"The Boss is openhanded today as well."</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="2">Goto</STYLE><STYLE ID="1"> opened the menu in high spirits.</STYLE><PG>
{MESOFF "500"}
{DELETECG "人物1,000,人物2" "1" "500" "0" "0" "" "0"}
{PLAYSND "SE\食器を動かす.ogg" "VOICE" "NORMAL" "1000" "0"}
{WAITPLAY "VOICE" "CLICK"}
{PLAYSND "SE\皿を置く.ogg" "VOICE" "NORMAL" "1000" "0"}
{WAITPLAY "VOICE" "CLICK"}
{WAIT "2000" "CLICK" "SKIP"}
{CREATECG "000" "グラフィック\背景\ザッハ中.gal" "NORMAL" "#1" "C" "B" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "255" ""}
{CREATECG "人物1" "グラフィック\立ち絵\人物\五島バストアップ.gal" "NORMAL" "#1" "R" "B" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "255" ""}
{CREATECG "人物2" "グラフィック\立ち絵\人物\春花バストアップ.gal" "NORMAL" "#1" "L" "B" "0" "1" "3000" "0" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "255" ""}
{WAIT "1000" "CLICK" "SKIP"}
{MESON "500"}
<STYLE ID="1">We finished ordering, and each of us came back from the drink bar.</STYLE> [TN: a self-serve drinks counter]
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
"Ah, <STYLE ID="2">Goto</STYLE>, there's one thing I want you to be careful about."
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="2">"Yep?"</STYLE><PG>
{MESOFF "500"}
{CHANGECG "人物2" "グラフィック\立ち絵\人物\春花腰に手1バストアップ.gal" "NORMAL" "1" "500" "0" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "255" ""}
{MESON "500"}
"If it were just me I wouldn't mind, but today <STYLE ID="4">Natsumi</STYLE> is here too. Anything that would spoil <STYLE ID="4">Natsumi</STYLE>'s meal, keep it until after we've eaten."
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
{MESOFF "500"}
{CHANGECG "人物1" "グラフィック\立ち絵\人物\五島考えるバストアップ.gal" "NORMAL" "1" "500" "0" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "255" ""}
{MESON "500"}
<STYLE ID="2">"As you command, </STYLE>Boss<STYLE ID="2">! I understand perfectly!"</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="2">Goto</STYLE><STYLE ID="1"> snapped off a salute.</STYLE><PG>
{MESOFF "500"}
{CHANGECG "人物2" "グラフィック\立ち絵\人物\春花腕組み.gal" "NORMAL" "" "0" "0" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "255" ""}
{CHANGECG "人物1" "グラフィック\立ち絵\人物\五島バストアップ.gal" "NORMAL" "1" "500" "0" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "255" ""}
{MESON "500"}
<STYLE ID="2">"Then, on to carrying out the Operation! Now, what shall I start with?"</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="1">As she said it, </STYLE><STYLE ID="2">Goto</STYLE><STYLE ID="1"> took a notepad out of her pocket.</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
{STOPSND "BGM" "2000" "PASS"}
<STYLE ID="1">And then, with a suddenly serious face, she began to stare at the notepad.</STYLE><PG>
{PLAYSND "日没廃校.ogg" "BGM" "REPEAT" "1000" "0"}
<STYLE ID="2">"Ummm... you already know that the body has been found, don't you?</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<STYLE ID="2">　The body was found at about 5:10 a.m. It was found by a 68-year-old man. </STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<STYLE ID="2">They say he had gone into the park to set up his food stall."</STYLE><PG>
<STYLE ID="2">"At that time the victim was still alive, they say. Apparently there was a moaning voice, asking for help. </STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<STYLE ID="2">The man was startled, but he called the police and an ambulance right away, and yet..."</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
{MESOFF "500"}
{CHANGECG "人物2" "グラフィック\立ち絵\人物\春花バストアップ.gal" "NORMAL" "1" "500" "0" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "255" ""}
{MESON "500"}
"Didn't make it in time, huh..."<PG>
<STYLE ID="2">"Yes. But all of that is in the news by now, so it isn't especially good information."</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
{MESOFF "500"}
