<BR>
{STOPSND "SE" "2000" "PASS"}
<STYLE ID="2">Goto</STYLE><STYLE ID="1">'s serious face went straight back into the noisy mode of a moment ago, and her hand shot up cheerfully.</STYLE><PG>
