{WAIT "1000" "CLICK" "SKIP"}
{MESON "500"}
<STYLE ID="2">"Ooh, amazing! A Special Steak 5 centimeters thick!</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<STYLE ID="2">　Well then, </STYLE>Niimura-senpai<STYLE ID="2">! Thank you for the meaaal!"</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="2">Goto</STYLE><STYLE ID="1"> began cutting the slab of meat with a clinking of cutlery.</STYLE><PG>
"So then, what is this information <STYLE ID="2">Goto</STYLE> went around hearing?"
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="2"><TXSPD TIME="4294967256">"Uhh, ho, yoo hee, vhere wah a himihar inhihenh, a himihar inhihenh hehoreuhh, ho, yoo hee, vhere wah a himihar inhihenh, a himihar inhihenh hehoreuhh, ho, yoo hee, vhere wah a himihar inhihenh, a himihar inhihenh hehore</STYLE>
<EVENT VALUE="TEXTCLEAR">
<PG>
<TXSPN>"Swallow the meat before you talk..."
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
Haruka<STYLE ID="1"> said that, and </STYLE><STYLE ID="2">Goto</STYLE><STYLE ID="1"> grinned from ear to ear and</STYLE>
{PLAYSND "SE\ごくり.ogg" "VOICE" "NORMAL" "1000" "0"}
<STYLE ID="1"> moved her throat with a gulp.</STYLE><PG>
<STYLE ID="2">"Mmm!</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<STYLE ID="2">　</STYLE>
{QUAKE "メッセージボックス土台" "QUAKE" "1" "15" "15" "0" "1"}
<STYLE ID="7">So good!</STYLE>
{QUAKESTOP "500"}
{PAUSE ""}
<STYLE ID="2">　This flavor, this volume, for this price! Well now, is this really beef?"</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
"Don't say weird things..."
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="2">"Ahahaha! I'm sorry."</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="2">Goto</STYLE><STYLE ID="1"> said that, and then took</STYLE>
{PLAYSND "SE\すする.ogg" "VOICE" "NORMAL" "900" "0"}
<STYLE ID="8"> one</STYLE><STYLE ID="1"> sip of her miso soup.</STYLE><PG>
<STYLE ID="2">"Haah... Um, so. </STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<STYLE ID="2">It seems there was one before as well. </STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<STYLE ID="2">A similar incident."</STYLE>
{STOPSND "BGM" "2000" "PASS"}
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
"Huh?"<BR>
<STYLE ID="4">"Huh?"</STYLE><PG>
{MESOFF "500"}
{PLAYSND "日没廃校.ogg" "BGM" "REPEAT" "1000" "50"}
{CHANGECG "000" "グラフィック\背景\ザッハ中.gal" "NORMAL" "" "0" "0" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "255" ""}
{CREATECG "人物1" "グラフィック\立ち絵\人物\五島バストアップ.gal" "NORMAL" "#1" "R" "B" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "255" ""}
{CREATECG "人物2" "グラフィック\立ち絵\人物\春花腰に手1バストアップ.gal" "NORMAL" "#1" "L" "B" "0" "1" "3000" "0" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "255" ""}
{WAIT "1000" "CLICK" "SKIP"}
{MESON "500"}
"A similar incident, meaning one like today's?"
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="2">"That's right. Well, I'll talk about the details after we eat. </STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<STYLE ID="9" RUBY="めがさわし">Megasawa City</STYLE><STYLE ID="2"> murders, do you know about them?"</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="4">"</STYLE><STYLE ID="10" RUBY="めがさわし">Megasawa City</STYLE><STYLE ID="4">... murders?"</STYLE><PG>
<STYLE ID="2">"Yes. In the neighboring </STYLE><STYLE ID="11" RUBY="いいざわけん">Iizawa Prefecture</STYLE><STYLE ID="2">, there is </STYLE><STYLE ID="9" RUBY="めがさわし">Megasawa City</STYLE><STYLE ID="2">. </STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<STYLE ID="2">There, every few years, and on April 8 at that, a brutalized body is found."</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="1">I had heard of it.</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="1">No, it was more than a matter of having heard of it.</STYLE><PG>
<STYLE ID="1">If I remembered right, from about 10 years ago, in the neighboring </STYLE><STYLE ID="12" RUBY="いいざわけん">Iizawa Prefecture</STYLE><STYLE ID="13" RUBY="めがさわし">, in Megasawa City</STYLE><STYLE ID="1">, murders have been happening every 3 years or so.</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="1">・Occurs every few years, always on April 8</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="1">・The body is found in a state horrific beyond the ordinary</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="1">・Two people killed each time</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="1">・A crime physically impossible for a human being</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="1">・Occurred three times in the past</STYLE><PG>
<STYLE ID="1">Moreover, they say the culprit still has not been caught.</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="1">I didn't remember the details, but the method in every case was so baffling that it could only be taken for the work of a spiriting-away.</STYLE> [TN: a disappearance blamed on gods or spirits]
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="1">The sort that would demand instantaneous movement, or a leap of several meters, or monstrous strength no human could produce.</STYLE><PG>
"I-I've heard something about that..."
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
Haruka<STYLE ID="1">'s face set hard, and she answered in a low voice.</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="2">"Actually, I've been looking into it because I thought this incident and the </STYLE><STYLE ID="9" RUBY="めがさわし">Megasawa City</STYLE><STYLE ID="2"> murders might be connected. </STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<STYLE ID="2">But then I made another new discovery."</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="1">And here, </STYLE><STYLE ID="2">Goto</STYLE><STYLE ID="1"> took a mouthful of cola and steadied her breath.</STYLE><PG>
<STYLE ID="2">"The first Megasawa City murders happened 10 years ago, on Shiyo 790, April 8. </STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<STYLE ID="2">But on April 8 some years before that,</STYLE>
{STOPSND "BGM" "0" "PASS"}
<STYLE ID="2">they say that here in Motoki-cho, in Chuo Park, one hanami visitor died."</STYLE> [TN: hanami = cherry-blossom viewing]
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="4">"Huh? In the Chuo Park we were in just now?"</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="2">"Yes, that Chuo Park. Which means that, counting today's incident, people have died on April 8 five times."</STYLE><PG>
{PLAYSND "残滓念.ogg" "BGM" "REPEAT" "1000" "0"}
<STYLE ID="1">Goosebumps rose on my skin.</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="1">In Motoki-cho even an incident is rare, and yet in the park, in the hanami season, a person had died.</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
"So, you're saying murders happened on April 8, twice in Motoki-cho and three times in Megasawa City..."<PG>
<STYLE ID="2">"No, that's a little off. </STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<STYLE ID="2">The first one, in Chuo Park in Motoki-cho, was purely an accidental death. There were plenty of witnesses, too. </STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<STYLE ID="2">They say an off-duty police officer was there for the hanami as well, so the chance of it being a case is zero. </STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<STYLE ID="2">Nom nom..."</STYLE><PG>
{MESOFF "500"}
{CHANGECG "人物2" "グラフィック\立ち絵\人物\春花腕組み.gal" "NORMAL" "1" "500" "0" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "255" ""}
{MESON "500"}
"Today's incident... and the Megasawa City murders... and the accident in Chuo Park more than 10 years ago...
{PAUSE ""}
Is that Chuo Park accident from more than 10 years ago connected to the other four incidents?"
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="2">"It's not."</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="2">Goto</STYLE><STYLE ID="1"> declared it flatly.</STYLE><PG>
<STYLE ID="2">"Senpai, your hands have stopped. Let's leave the rest until after we eat. </STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<STYLE ID="2">Oh, may I add an order for the spring-only parfait?"</STYLE><PG>
{MESOFF "500"}
{CHANGECG "人物2" "グラフィック\立ち絵\人物\春花バストアップ.gal" "NORMAL" "1" "500" "0" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "255" ""}
{MESON "500"}
"Huh? Ah... eat whatever you want."
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
Haruka<STYLE ID="1"> carried a slice of pizza to her mouth as if she had just remembered it.</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="1">I carried spaghetti to my mouth the same way.</STYLE>
{STOPSND "BGM" "3000" "PASS"}
<PG>
<STYLE ID="2">"By the way, changing the subject, do many people from our high school go to universities outside the prefecture?"</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
{PLAYSND "日常.ogg" "BGM" "REPEAT" "1000" "0"}
"Hm? No, it's pretty rare. Apparently the members barely change from middle school to high school to university."
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="2">"Is that so. I'm still not sure which university to apply to."</STYLE><PG>
<STYLE ID="4">"</STYLE><STYLE ID="2">Goto</STYLE><STYLE ID="4">, you're smart, so I'm sure you'll get in wherever you want."</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
{MESOFF "500"}
{CHANGECG "人物1" "グラフィック\立ち絵\人物\五島挨拶バストアップ.gal" "NORMAL" "1" "500" "0" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "255" ""}
{MESON "500"}
<STYLE ID="2">"Ehehee! I'm the genius girl, by my own account and everyone else's!"</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="2">Goto</STYLE><STYLE ID="1"> turned to me and grinned from ear to ear.</STYLE><PG>
{MESOFF "500"}
{CHANGECG "人物1" "グラフィック\立ち絵\人物\五島バストアップ.gal" "NORMAL" "1" "500" "0" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "255" ""}
{MESON "500"}
<STYLE ID="2">"But, leaving Motoki-cho would be lonely... </STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<STYLE ID="2">Come to think of it, </STYLE>Niimura-senpai<STYLE ID="2">, you left this town once, didn't you?"</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
{MESOFF "500"}
{CHANGECG "人物2" "グラフィック\立ち絵\人物\春花腕組み.gal" "NORMAL" "1" "500" "0" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "255" ""}
{MESON "500"}
"Yeah, I lived here in Motoki-cho until kindergarten, but it was Dad's work.
{PAUSE ""}
3 years ago Dad finally got transferred overseas, so it became a posting away from the family.
{PAUSE ""}
Just me and <STYLE ID="14">Mom</STYLE>, we came back to this town."
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
Haruka<STYLE ID="1"> said all this while starting to pour a huge amount of Tabasco onto her pizza.</STYLE><PG>
<STYLE ID="4">"............?</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<STYLE ID="4">　Huh...?"</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
{MESOFF "500"}
{CHANGECG "人物1" "グラフィック\立ち絵\人物\五島考えるバストアップ.gal" "NORMAL" "1" "500" "0" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "255" ""}
{MESON "500"}
<STYLE ID="2">"Huh? You two have been friends since kindergarten? That's the first I've heard of it."</STYLE><PG>
{MESOFF "500"}
{CHANGECG "人物2" "グラフィック\立ち絵\人物\春花バストアップ.gal" "NORMAL" "1" "500" "0" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "255" ""}
{MESON "500"}
"Didn't I tell you?
{PAUSE ""}
　Our moms were childhood friends, and through that we've been friends since we were old enough to remember.
{PAUSE ""}
After I moved away it was letters and email.
{PAUSE ""}
3 years ago, once it was settled that we would move back to Motoki-cho, <STYLE ID="4">Natsumi</STYLE> told me, 'the place next door is empty'.
{PAUSE ""}
<STYLE ID="14">Mom</STYLE> let me have my way, and we moved into the apartment we're in now."
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
Haruka<STYLE ID="1"> spoke in a soft voice, as if remembering fondly.</STYLE><PG>
{MESOFF "500"}
{CHANGECG "人物1" "グラフィック\立ち絵\人物\五島挨拶バストアップ.gal" "NORMAL" "1" "500" "0" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "255" ""}
{MESON "500"}
<STYLE ID="2">"I see indeed!</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<STYLE ID="2">　Come to think of it, did you know? Motoki-cho is famous for its cherry trees, and they say the population keeps growing!</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<STYLE ID="2">　It seems a lot of people move here for the cherry blossom. The population has passed 40,000 already, so it's only a matter of time before it becomes Motoki 'City'."</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
"Huh! I knew Motoki-cho was famous for cherries, but so that's why the population has grown this much!
{PAUSE ""}
　Come to think of it, there are all kinds of buildings going up everywhere!
{PAUSE ""}
<STYLE ID="1">　</STYLE>Above all, the goshinboku in Chuo Park really is something."<PG>
{MESOFF "500"}
{CHANGECG "人物1" "グラフィック\立ち絵\人物\五島バストアップ.gal" "NORMAL" "1" "500" "0" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "255" ""}
{MESON "500"}
<STYLE ID="2">"That's true! Oh! Speaking of cherries―"</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
"Uh... <STYLE ID="2">Goto</STYLE>... let's drop the cherry talk about now..."
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="2">"Oh... I'm sorry, </STYLE><STYLE ID="4">Kogori-senpai</STYLE><STYLE ID="2">..."</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="4">"Huh?"</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="1">Ah, I see. She must have thought that talking too much about cherries in front of me was a bad idea.</STYLE><PG>
<STYLE ID="4">"Ahaha, just talking about it doesn't bother me. It's fine."</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="1">Making the people around me feel they have to be careful like this is, apparently, another feature of the April sickness.</STYLE><PG>
<STYLE ID="4">"</STYLE>Haruka<STYLE ID="4"> coming back made me really happy! But still, not having your dad around is lonely, isn't it...? </STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<STYLE ID="15">My dad</STYLE><STYLE ID="4"> has only been away on a business trip to Hokkaido since yesterday, and even that is lonely..."</STYLE><PG>
{MESOFF "500"}
{CHANGECG "人物2" "グラフィック\立ち絵\人物\春花腕組み.gal" "NORMAL" "1" "500" "0" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "255" ""}
{MESON "500"}
"Honestly, <STYLE ID="4">Natsumi</STYLE>... <STYLE ID="4">You</STYLE> really are a daddy's girl..."
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="4">"Huuuh? But with family you do want to be close to them, don't you?"</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="1">Having talked that far, I happened to look over toward </STYLE><STYLE ID="2">Goto</STYLE><STYLE ID="1">―</STYLE><PG>
{MESOFF "500"}
{DELETECG "000,人物2" "1" "2000" "0" "0" "" "0"}
{MESON "500"}
<STYLE ID="2">"............"</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="2">Goto</STYLE><STYLE ID="1">'s face turned solemn for an instant, but</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="2">"That's nice, being close since you were little. I'm envious."</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="2">Goto</STYLE><STYLE ID="1"> grinned from ear to ear at once.</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="1">That expression </STYLE><STYLE ID="2">Goto</STYLE><STYLE ID="1"> had just now...</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="1">Had we said something strange?</STYLE>
{CREATECG "リファレンス解禁画像" "グラフィック\システム\リファレンス解禁画像.gal" "NORMAL" "#1" "72" "600" "0" "1" "0" "0" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "255" ""}
<PG>
{DELETECG "人物1" "1" "500" "0" "0" "" "0"}
{WAIT "1000" "CLICK" "SKIP"}
{MESON "500"}
<STYLE ID="2">"Thanks for the foooood! That was gooood!"</STYLE><PG>
{MESOFF "0"}
{CREATECG "000" "グラフィック\背景\ザッハ中.gal" "NORMAL" "#1" "C" "B" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "255" ""}
{CREATECG "人物1" "グラフィック\立ち絵\人物\五島バストアップ.gal" "NORMAL" "#1" "R" "B" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "255" ""}
{CREATECG "人物2" "グラフィック\立ち絵\人物\春花バストアップ.gal" "NORMAL" "#1" "L" "B" "0" "1" "2000" "0" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "255" ""}
{MESON "500"}
"Did that fill you up?"
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
{MESOFF "500"}
{CHANGECG "人物1" "グラフィック\立ち絵\人物\五島挨拶バストアップ.gal" "NORMAL" "1" "500" "0" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "255" ""}
{MESON "500"}
<STYLE ID="2">"Not yet, not yet! The spring-limited parfait is yet to arrive!"</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="2">Goto</STYLE><STYLE ID="1"> gave a beaming grin from ear to ear.</STYLE><PG>
"Haha, that's right."
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
{MESOFF "500"}
{CHANGECG "人物1" "グラフィック\立ち絵\人物\五島バストアップ.gal" "NORMAL" "1" "500" "0" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "255" ""}
{MESON "500"}
<STYLE ID="2">"Well then, now that everyone has finished eating, on with the story."</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
{MESOFF "500"}
{CHANGECG "人物2" "グラフィック\立ち絵\人物\春花腕組み.gal" "WAIT" "1" "500" "0" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "255" ""}
{STOPSND "BGM" "3000" "PASS"}
{MESON "500"}
"Right, go ahead."
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="2">"Ahem. Well then..."</STYLE><PG>
{PLAYSND "日没廃校.ogg" "BGM" "REPEAT" "1000" "0"}
<STYLE ID="2">"At this season, come 5 a.m., a fair number of people come to the park. </STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<STYLE ID="2">It has gotten warmer, so the elderly take walks and students do morning practice. And of course setting up the food stalls."</STYLE><PG>
"So the body being found at 5 a.m. isn't all that unnatural, then."
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="2">"That's right. The point is that between the discovery and the police arriving, the body―</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<STYLE ID="2">to be exact, the victim who was on the way to becoming a body, was seen by a great many people. </STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<STYLE ID="2">But..."</STYLE><PG>
"But...?"<BR>
<STYLE ID="4">"But...?"</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="1">Together with </STYLE>Haruka<STYLE ID="1">, I swallowed with a gulp.</STYLE><PG>
<STYLE ID="2">"Not one person could tell the face, or the sex, or the age. </STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<STYLE ID="2">Do you understand what this means?"</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
"But that was in the online news too. That they couldn't tell the sex and so on."
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="2">"That is the police's point of view. </STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<STYLE ID="2">What matters is that 'the witnesses were ordinary people'."</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
"What's that supposed to mean?"<PG>
<STYLE ID="2">"Now listen. The police are, when all is said and done, a public body. They do not put out opinions with anything subjective in them. </STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<STYLE ID="2">They release nothing but objective information."</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
"Uh-huh..."
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="1">Somehow, </STYLE><STYLE ID="2">Goto</STYLE><STYLE ID="1">'s talk was getting hard to follow.</STYLE><PG>
<STYLE ID="2">"But what about ordinary people? Don't they talk about things only subjectively?</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<STYLE ID="2">'Probably a man', 'probably someone young', that sort of thing; I think they would say at least that much."</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
"Well, true enough..."
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="2">"But the fact that there is none of that means the damage to the body was so severe that not even the sex could be told. </STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<STYLE ID="2">And yet! At the time of discovery the victim was still alive!</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<STYLE ID="1">　</STYLE><STYLE ID="2">There is only one situation, I think, that leaves a body like that."</STYLE><PG>
<STYLE ID="1">The mood of the </STYLE><STYLE ID="2">Goto</STYLE><STYLE ID="1"> who had been grinning from ear to ear until a moment ago was not to be seen in the slightest.</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="1">We were listening intently to </STYLE><STYLE ID="2">Goto</STYLE><STYLE ID="1">'s words.</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="16">And then </STYLE><STYLE ID="2">Goto</STYLE><STYLE ID="1"> took a mouthful of water and said this.</STYLE><PG>
{DELETECG "000,人物1,人物2" "1" "0" "0" "0" "" "0"}
{STOPSND "BGM" "0" "PASS"}
{MESOFF "0"}
{}
